    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectDetected? THEN\n\t\t\tDO ApproachObject\n\tELSE\n\t\tDO GrabObject\n\t\tDO MoveToDestination\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectInCorrectPosition? THEN\n\t\t\tDO ProcessObjectProperties\n\tEND\n"
